      "candidates": "up to k of {source, id, version?, name, folder, overlap, fit(strong|weak|judged), runnable_by_id, mutating?, leaf_type?, ai?} sorted by overlap desc; version is present for persisted workflows so a caller can form \u003cid\u003e@\u003cversion\u003e",
      "learning": "Durable feedback_ref identifying this search; a caller that later finds the candidate set was wrong grades it with learn.feedback without repeating any read.",
      "normalization_source": "Where the row mapping came from: cache | baseline | fallback | model | unavailable. Absent when no owner returned rows.",
      "sources": "row counts per source: workflows_list, workflow_health (null when no scenario was given), search_hub; null when that source failed",
